= Solution
{parent=c}

With $p=(1+\varepsilon)\log n/(n-1)$, the <union bound> gives
$$\mathbb P(L=0)\le n(1-p)^{n-1}
\le ne^{-p(n-1)}=n^{-\varepsilon}.$$

Solved by gpt-5.6-sol high.

