Thus $\operatorname{Var}(L)\le\ell2^b/n$. Chebyshev's inequality gives
$$\mathbb P\left(\frac{|L-\ell|}{\ell}\ge\alpha\sqrt{\frac{2^b}{n\ell}}\right)\le\frac1{\alpha^2}.$$

